WEBVTT

00:38:29.000 --> 00:38:31.726
One is prioritizing
other people's feelings

00:38:31.750 --> 00:38:33.518
above your own priorities.

00:38:33.542 --> 00:38:35.226
EP: Consistently.
AG: Consistently.

00:38:35.250 --> 00:38:37.059
Not in one situation, but habitually.

00:38:37.083 --> 00:38:40.018
EP: Yeah, yeah.
AG: I think about --

00:38:40.042 --> 00:38:41.559
EP: In order to avoid ...

00:38:41.583 --> 00:38:44.351
AG: Conflict, which is
the next thing, right?

00:38:44.375 --> 00:38:46.292
EP: And the conflict stems from?

00:38:47.500 --> 00:38:49.226
AG: Is this a test?
EP: No, no.

00:38:49.250 --> 00:38:51.893
It's really, it's -- what am I avoiding?

00:38:51.917 --> 00:38:53.559
I'm avoiding the wrath of others.

00:38:53.583 --> 00:38:56.393
AG: Yeah, no, that's exactly right.
I don't want to, yeah.

00:38:56.417 --> 00:39:00.018
As the kid who was always afraid
of being called to the principal's office,